Replaces: pe-utils
Description: pelion utilities (stargate)
 Utilities and a light-weight programs for Pelion Edge.
 .
 This is the stargate variant. edge-core runs in a container rather than
 as a host service, so this package drops the mbed-edge-core dependency
 and does not order wait-for-pelion-identity.service after
 edge-core.service. It replaces the pe-utils package. Install pe-utils
 instead for KaaS.
